---
description: Trace a rights or attribution change to each print, web and promotional derivative that uses the item.
args: { dossier: RightsDossier; change: RightsChange; compatibility: UseCompatibility[] }
returns: RightsDerivative[]
---
Follow each asset's item-level dependency list. Update only derivatives using the changed permission or attribution. Distinguish a correction notice, replacement asset, removal obligation and review hold. Keep a receipt for each affected channel; never mark updates complete from a proposed task.
